WEBVTT

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:00.210
(Applause)

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:03.880
I am not that learned to understand 
everything you explained to us today,

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.390
but there are a couple 
of thoughts I have had,

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:09.150
whose answers I’d like to know from you.

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:12.430
For all the girls sitting 
here, also the boys,

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:18.770
how does a girl like you from a normal 
middle class family

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:21.990
go so far away from home?
And 20 years ago?

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:25.380
Your parents believed in you 
to let you go and gave you that freedom

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:28.290
which is quite a big deal.
Would you like to say something,

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:31.490
so that other parents, too, would encourage
their kids to do the same?